{"ticker":"GIS","updated":"2026-10-23T23:02:01Z","profile":{"longName":"General Mills, Inc.","shortName":"General Mills, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","country":"United States","website":"https://www.generalmills.com","fullTimeEmployees":30000,"marketCap":18387890176,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":10.909633,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.0049894,"pegRatio":11.74,"targetMeanPrice":37.0,"targetHighPrice":45.0,"targetLowPrice":30.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":18,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":-0.028,"earningsGrowth":-0.667,"grossMargins":0.33728,"operatingMargins":0.15243,"profitMargins":-0.04891,"totalRevenue":18296600576,"beta":0.02,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":49.59,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":31.18,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":6.94},"summary":"General Mills, Inc. manufactures and markets branded consumer food in the United States and internationally. The company operates through four segments: North America Retail; International; North America Pet; and North America Foodservice. It offers snacks, including grain, fruit and savory snacks, nutrition bars, and frozen hot snacks; ready-to-eat cereal; convenient meals comprising meal kits, ethnic meals, pizza, soup, side dish mixes, frozen breakfast, and frozen entrees; wholesome natural pet food; refrigerated and frozen dough; baking mixes and ingredients; and ice cream products. The company also offers dog and cat food, such as dry food, wet food, fresh food, and treats. In addition, it operates 232 and franchises 376 ice cream parlors. The company markets its products under the Annie's, Betty Crocker, Bisquick, Blue Buffalo, Bugles, Cascadian Farm, Cheerios, Chex, Cinnamon Toast Crunch, Cocoa Puffs, Cookie Crisp, Dunkaroos, Edgard & Cooper, Fiber One, Fruit by the Foot, Fruit Gushers, Fruit Roll-Ups, Gardetto's, Gold Medal, Golden Grahams, Häagen-Dazs, Kitano, Kix, Lärabar, Latina, Lucky Charms, Nature Valley, Nudges, Oatmeal Crisp, Old El Paso, Pillsbury, Progresso, Tastefuls, Tiki Pets, Total, Totino's, Trix, True Solutions, Wanchai Ferry, Wheaties, Wilderness, and Yoki brands. It sells its products to grocery stores, mass merchandisers, membership stores, natural fo","summary_zh":"General Mills, Inc. 在美國和國際上生產和銷售品牌消費食品。該公司透過四個部門運營：北美零售；國際的;北美寵物；和北美餐飲服務。提供零食，包括穀物、水果和鹹味零食、營養棒和冷凍熱零食；即食麥片；方便餐，包括餐包、民族餐、披薩、湯、配菜、冷凍早餐和冷凍主菜；有益健康的天然寵物食品；冷藏和冷凍麵團；烘焙混合物和配料；和冰淇淋產品。該公司還提供狗糧和貓糧，如乾糧、濕糧、新鮮食品和零食。此外，它還經營 232 家冰淇淋店和 376 家特許經營冰淇淋店。該公司銷售的產品有 Annie's、Betty Crocker、Bisquick、Blue Buffalo、Bugles、Cascadian Farm、Cheerios、Chex、Cinnamon Toast Crunch、Cocoa Puffs、Cookie Crisp、Dunkaroos、Edgard & Cooper、Fiber One、Fruit by the Foot、Cookie Crisp、Dunkaroos、Edgard & Cooper、Fiber One、Fruit by the Foot、Fruit Cris Gushers、Goldens、Goldens' Grahams、哈根達斯、Kitano、Kix、Lärabar、Latina、Lucky Charms、Nature Valley、Nudges、Oatmeal Crisp、Old El Paso、Pillsbury、Progresso、Tastefuls、Tiki Pets、Total、Totino's、Trix、True Solutions、灣仔碼頭、Wheaties Pets、okiir 和 Yotino's、kokix、True Solutions、灣仔碼頭、Wheaties、oki 品牌。它向雜貨店、大賣場、會員商店、天然食品店銷售其產品。","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"包裝食品","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":49.99,"h":50.38,"l":49.15,"c":49.33,"v":4709900},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":49.2,"h":49.28,"l":48.94,"c":49.25,"v":10987700},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":49.25,"h":49.51,"l":48.99,"c":49.25,"v":5671500},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":49.25,"h":49.28,"l":48.29,"c":48.44,"v":6716800},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":48.6,"h":49.34,"l":48.51,"c":49.33,"v":4881100},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":49.43,"h":49.91,"l":48.87,"c":49.32,"v":6253500},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":48.93,"h":49.78,"l":48.92,"c":49.75,"v":5293700},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":50.0,"h":50.4,"l":49.55,"c":49.61,"v":4170500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":49.56,"h":50.75,"l":49.43,"c":50.58,"v":5353100},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":50.23,"h":50.39,"l":49.67,"c":50.12,"v":4623400},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":50.13,"h":50.41,"l":50.01,"c":50.35,"v":4362900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":50.04,"h":50.21,"l":49.43,"c":50.01,"v":5180900},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":50.19,"h":50.98,"l":50.1,"c":50.